  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "secret-tell",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "You came. Good. Sit. Look out there: past the clouds, that's the Layland. Every road, every city, every Cathedral.",
      "next": "secret-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "There are seven of them down there. The Emperors. The strongest beings in the world. Nobody knows where they came from, only that nothing has ever stopped them.",
      "next": "secret-3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Every hero the Benefactor sends is told the same thing: train, grow strong, and one day stand against them. Most never come back to tell me how it went.",
      "next": "secret-4",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-4",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "And the secret? You didn't drag me up a mountain to talk about the view.",
      "next": "secret-5",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 450
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-5",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "I've been sent to the Cathedrals more times than I can count. Every time I fell, I woke up on that cold floor. And I've never once prayed in one.",
      "next": "secret-6",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-6",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Remember that. Whatever they tell you about the Benefactor, keep your eyes open. Gifts always come from somewhere.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Why tell me this?",
          "next": "secret-7",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "the-first-emperor"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 750
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-7",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Because you listen. Because... wait. Do you feel that? The wind just stopped.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-arrives",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Get behind me. NOW.",
      "next": "alpha-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alpha-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "...Alpha. That's impossible. The Emperors don't come here. They never come here.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
